        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;- solid green: request through the agent (Amazon Nova)&#10;- dashed green/red: token minting + secret read&#10;- solid purple: MCP gateway → backend&#10;- dashed blue: Live-backend-data demo path (frontend → API directly)&#10;- dashed orange box: deploy-time only (CodeBuild → ECR image)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;rounded=1;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
